File Index: 9 of 109
Audio ID: 7694571612683782245
Audio Duration: 2m 16.9s (136.86s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:09:38 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 13 | Text: 帅过无数跟头 吃了数不清的亏
Segment #2   [00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,860] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 12 | Text: 才彻底摸透的八个现实真相
Segment #3   [00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,820] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 14 | Text: 早点明白 至少能帮你少走五年弯路
Segment #4   [00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:09,280] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 12 | Text: 第一 别随便跟任何人掏心窝子
Segment #5   [00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:10,460] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 你以为说的是心理话
Segment #6   [00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,420] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 别人听的是八卦
Segment #7   [00:00:11,420 --> 00:00:13,220] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 11 | Text: 转头就能当成拿紧你的把柄
Segment #8   [00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,440] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 你把人家当知己
Segment #9   [00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,560] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 14 | Text: 人家可能只把你当茶鱼饭后的谈资
Segment #10  [00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,020] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 记住 成年人说话
Segment #11  [00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,700] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 留三分余地 手齐分底盘
Segment #12  [00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,820] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 这不是虚伪 是自保
Segment #13  [00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,540] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 第二 永远不要试图讨好所有人
Segment #14  [00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:24,480] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 你做的再周全
Segment #15  [00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,680] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 也有人看你不顺眼
Segment #16  [00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:27,060] | Elapsed:  16.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 你在迁就退让
Segment #17  [00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,640] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 也有人不懂得满足
Segment #18  [00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,920] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 12 | Text: 与其花心思去凑别人的热闹
Segment #19  [00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:33,020] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 11 | Text: 不如把精力全用在自己身上
Segment #20  [00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,360] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 你不需要所有人都喜欢
Segment #21  [00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,300] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 10 | Text: 你只需要让自己变得足够重要
Segment #22  [00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:38,700] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 第三 没有冷脚的善良
Segment #23  [00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,060] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 根本换不来尊重
Segment #24  [00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:42,360] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 13 | Text: 你越好说话 别人就越得寸进尺
Segment #25  [00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,500] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 13 | Text: 你越懂忍耐 别人就越敢欺负你
Segment #26  [00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:45,740] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的善良要带牙齿
Segment #27  [00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:46,940] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 你的客气要有底线
Segment #28  [00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,380] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 该翻脸时就翻脸
Segment #29  [00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,340] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 11 | Text: 你的疯忙才是别人尊重你的开始
Segment #30  [00:00:50,860 --> 00:00:53,460] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 12 | Text: 第四 永远不要向不重要的人解释自己
Segment #31  [00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,960] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 7  | Text: 懂你的人不言而喻
Segment #32  [00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,280] | Elapsed:  34.85s | Words: 8  | Text: 不懂你的人白口莫辨
Segment #33  [00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,840] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 你越在意别人的评价
Segment #34  [00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,580] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 11 | Text: 就越容易被别人牵着鼻子走
Segment #35  [00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,280] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 你的人生是活给自己看
Segment #36  [00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:04,060] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 15 | Text: 别把评判你的权利随便交到别人嘴里
Segment #37  [00:01:04,060 --> 00:01:05,700] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 第五 谁承担后果
Segment #38  [00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:06,800] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 谁才有资格做决定
Segment #39  [00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,080] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 亲戚劝你安稳都日
Segment #40  [00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:09,380] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 朋友劝你辞职创业
Segment #41  [00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:11,760] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 13 | Text: 可他们不会替你过柴明油盐的日子
Segment #42  [00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:13,940] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 13 | Text: 更不会替你承担半分亏损的风险
Segment #43  [00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:15,800] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 所有人都站在岸上说话
Segment #44  [00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,580] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 真正在水里烫的只有你自己
Segment #45  [00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,740] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 10 | Text: 别人的建议听一听就好
Segment #46  [00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:21,380] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 9  | Text: 最终的单只能你自己买
Segment #47  [00:01:21,380 --> 00:01:23,200] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 7  | Text: 第六 人为言情的时候
Segment #48  [00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,960] | Elapsed:  54.20s | Words: 8  | Text: 少讲道理多攒实力
Segment #49  [00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,720] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 10 | Text: 说的再对也没人当回事
Segment #50  [00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,800] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 4  | Text: 你有实力的时候
Segment #51  [00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:31,200] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 11 | Text: 就算不说话也有人敬你三分
Segment #52  [00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:33,380] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 11 | Text: 道理从来都不是靠嘴争出来的
Segment #53  [00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:34,860] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 是靠你的实力撑起来的
Segment #54  [00:01:34,860 --> 00:01:35,700] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 先站稳脚跟
Segment #55  [00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:37,200] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 再讲立场先提升自己
Segment #56  [00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,360] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 4  | Text: 再谈道理
Segment #57  [00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:40,300] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 8  | Text: 第七 大部分人情往来
Segment #58  [00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:41,680] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 本质都是价值交换
Segment #59  [00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,460] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 你有用的时候身边全是笑脸
Segment #60  [00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:44,040] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 全是朋友
Segment #61  [00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,400] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 6  | Text: 你落魄没用的时候
Segment #62  [00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,300] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 最先冷落你的
Segment #63  [00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:47,800] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 往往就是你认识的熟人
Segment #64  [00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,960] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 别高无感情
Segment #65  [00:01:48,960 --> 00:01:49,720] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 别低无人性
Segment #66  [00:01:49,720 --> 00:01:50,480] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 4  | Text: 自己有价值
Segment #67  [00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,360] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 比什么都靠谱
Segment #68  [00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:53,120] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 9  | Text: 第八 生活里九层的烦恼
Segment #69  [00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,460] | Elapsed:  73.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 本质都是没钱闹的
Segment #70  [00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:55,380] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 家人之间的矛盾
Segment #71  [00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:56,520] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 朋友之间的隔阂
Segment #72  [00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:58,060] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 感情里的鸡铃狗碎
Segment #73  [00:01:58,060 --> 00:01:59,860] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 说到底大多都是穷出来的
Segment #74  [00:01:59,860 --> 00:02:01,400] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 别把时间浪费在争对错
Segment #75  [00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,160] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 闹情绪上
Segment #76  [00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,180] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 多琢磨怎么赚钱
Segment #77  [00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:04,040] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 5  | Text: 怎么及时之水
Segment #78  [00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,900] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 成年人的底气都是钱给的
Segment #79  [00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:07,940] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 10 | Text: 少采坑不亏钱本身就是赚
Segment #80  [00:02:07,940 --> 00:02:08,820] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 7  | Text: 最后一句话记住
Segment #81  [00:02:08,820 --> 00:02:10,120] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 8  | Text: 成年人的生存法则
Segment #82  [00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,600] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 9  | Text: 从来不是一位善良忍让
Segment #83  [00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:12,860] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是清醒自持
Segment #84  [00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:13,580] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 先护好自己
Segment #85  [00:02:13,580 --> 00:02:14,460] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 再顾好生活
Segment #86  [00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,600] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #87  [00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,620] | Elapsed:  90.09s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
